    "contracts": [
      "Initialize persistent PharaohBuildingInfoDrawBindings with borrowed providers; initialization installs ui.operations and its own address as user_data. Do not copy bindings after installation. Keep all borrowed contexts and saved pools alive and fully initialized for their existing canonical provider.",
      "storage supplies common actual layout/text/font views. ui.text_width aliases text.drawing.cursor_x(E20778); wrapped.draw_state is text.drawing; cursor_y is actualE20774. Layout/highlight/window selectors agree. The five LiveOperations text fonts are exactly black/green/white/red/title IDs; full walker renderer owns the separateF56FBC name font.",
      "Inner/outer/border/square/image-button and unit contexts share the same image renderer, locked pixels, pitch, draw scratch and actual saved UI/pools. A local image-button state copy retains all pointed cells and binds genuine pharaoh_image_draw. No pixels, pools or saved records are copied.",
      "House/terrain use the whole content chain, including4FA780 and4FAB20. Preview renderer equals the supplied city renderer. House view aliases the actual building pool. Portrait scripts alias actual48-byte5E4C20 records and selected low BYTE784CB0.",
      "Use the support helpers before direct parent dispatch, or the checked background/foreground wrappers. Missing providers remain NULL and are rejected before dispatch. Actual Native default types stay genuine defaults without no-op callbacks. Palace/mansion foreground is rejected for its exact seven types.",
      "City background calls the genuine pharaoh_city_render_current_view and requires every real city pass, including43B630 footprint. Missing pass is a checked refusal, never fabricated drawing.",
      "Building sample callback calls the complete55F0E8 provider with actual request{owner,file_id,volume,pan,loop_count}. A real DigitalSoundDeviceContext is required only when the parent would play its first-draw sample.",
      "Unit callbacks retain PercentageScaleStatus in bindings.arithmetic. The background parent has no stateful work after its unit callback. Checked wrapper returns the exact divide status immediately; host must raise the Native IDIV exception before any other action. Pending fault blocks later checked foreground/background drawing and is never converted to zero.",
      "This operation table is draw-only. advisor_input,festival_input,storage_scrollbar,legion_order remain NULL. Do not call handle_input with this table. No unavailable parent gets a pass-through callback.",
      "Readiness checks validate availability and key shared-state links, not arbitrary asset integrity. All real font, bitmap, sound/device, projection, geometry and data contexts retain their existing canonical preconditions."
    ],
